  "metadata": {
    "title": "Atlas Shop",
    "description": "Global event-sourced order shop. Commands append immutable events to a regional event store, Kafka carries the stream, projections build eventually-consistent read models, and MirrorMaker 2 mirrors events between regions. The diagrams show one regional stamp (EU); the US region runs the identical topology.",
